            "review_title": "Review at Khao Lao",
            "review_text": "Mohanad A\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam20 contributions\n0\nWorst food ever\nOct 2022 • Solo\nI tried to eat dinner in Khao lao in landmark 81 mall. I ordered a beef dish which was supposed to be made in a lao way. It was uneatable. One of the pieces was even a bone. I wouldn't give this food to my dog. Even the salad tasted horrible. I will never try this again.\nWritten October 31, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
