            "review_title": "Review at Khao Lao",
            "review_text": "spktravels\nTallman, New York360 contributions\n0\nPleasant lunch\nMay 2019 • Couples\nI am reviewing the branch in the Crescent mall. \n\nThere are many different Laotian dishes served here. \n\nWe were not terribly hungry so we limited ourselves to stir fried noodles and calamari. \n\nBoth were tasty although the noodles were accompanied with pork sausage which I did not eat. \n\nWe enjoyed our tea beverages as well as a jellied desert. \n\nService was friendly but slow.\nRead more\nWritten May 7, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
